      "comment": "Reizenbou: Reizenbou and Thundering Pulse",
      "content": "Thundering Pulse is a thunder-crackling longbow made by the Raiden Shogun and gifted to the Great Tengu Reizenbou. She lost it in a bet to the swordsman Takamine, who left it with Asase Hibiki as the stake in a promise to return from the Abyss. Hibiki received it after he did not come back and later used it to pierce him when his darkened remains returned.",
